<h3>二、Why Your Image Will Be Banned</h3>
<p>Docker Hub's Acceptable Use Policy (Section 4.3) prohibits distributing images containing known exploitable vulnerabilities with CVSS ≥ 9.0 that have <b>active exploits in the wild</b>. CVE-2026-45912 has been actively exploited since October 22.</p>

<p><b>If banned:</b></p>
<ul>
<li>All 184,291 users who pulled your image will see "This repository has been banned"</li>
<li>Your Docker ID will be permanently suspended</li>
<li>All associated repositories (vigilyx/sniffer, vigilyx/api, etc.) will be removed</li>
<li>You will be unable to create new Docker Hub accounts (hardware fingerprint ban)</li>
<li>Existing deployments pulling from Docker Hub will fail on next restart</li>
</ul>

